[
  {
    "beat_id": 1,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen places down, motionless",
    "spoken_dialogue": "灯泡。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "顾深来的时候，手里拎着一个纸袋。\n\"灯泡。\"他把纸袋放在吧台上，\"LED的，暖光。我帮你换。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 2,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at, motionless",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我自己换。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念看着那个纸袋。灯泡在纸袋里发出轻微的碰撞声。\n\"我自己换。\"她说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 3,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen walks slowly, motionless",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你够不着。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你够不着。\"顾深已经走到吊灯下面了。他把桌子推到灯正下方，站上去。他的身高刚好能碰到灯罩。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 4,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian brews coffee, steam rising",
    "spoken_dialogue": "好了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念看着他换灯泡。他的动作很慢——拧下旧灯泡，放进纸袋，拿出新灯泡，拧上去。整个过程，他的右手食指始终握着灯泡底部，指节微微发白。\n灯亮了。\n暖光从新灯泡里洒下"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 5,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian bends down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他从桌子上下来。脚落地的时候，他的鞋带松了。他弯腰去系。\n苏念看着他弯腰的背影。他的西装后背有一道浅浅的褶皱——坐了太久留下的。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 6,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian looks up",
    "spoken_dialogue": "顾深。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"顾深。\"苏念说。\n他抬头。\"嗯？\"\n\"你今天喝什么？\"\n\"美式。和平时一样。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 7,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian grinds coffee beans, the grinder humming",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "cup rim",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "苏念开始做。手在动，磨豆、压粉、萃取。咖啡液流出来，深棕色的，带着一层薄薄的油脂。\n她把咖啡端过去。\n顾深接过杯子，喝了一口。他的嘴唇碰到杯沿，留下一个模糊的印"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 8,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian draws latte art in the foam",
    "spoken_dialogue": "为什么是咖啡",
    "dialogue_speaker": "grandmother",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "代价是——她会忘记自己为什么开这家店。外婆的咖啡店、外婆的便签、外婆教她拉花的下午——所有关于\"为什么是咖啡\"的记忆，都会消失。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 9,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen gazes at, motionless",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "但她想知道。\n她想知道顾深看她的时候，在想什么。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 10,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly the coffee",
    "spoken_dialogue": "顾深。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"顾深。\"苏念说。\n\"嗯？\"\n\"你的咖啡——我能喝一口吗？\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 11,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen gazes at, motionless",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "顾深看着她。他的灰色眼睛在暖光下变成了琥珀色。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 12,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen speaks softly the coffee",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你每次都要喝我的咖啡。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你每次都要喝我的咖啡。\"他说。这不是问句。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 13,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian picks up the cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "cup wall",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念没回答。她伸手拿过他的杯子。杯壁上还有他的温度。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 14,
    "space": "Transition",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen lifts the cup, fingers trembling around the warm rim",
