    "focus_object": "scar on ring finger",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "[reading mind template]"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 17,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen sits down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "念想咖啡店收购计划",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "watercolor painting",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "*画面四：巷子里。月光把她的影子拉到他脚边。他想——我应该说点什么。但我不知道该说什么。我从来不擅长说。*\n*画面五：她站在吧台后面，手在发抖。他想——她在怕什"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 18,
    "space": "Mental",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian snaps eyes open",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "cup wall",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "*画面七：他站在灯泡货架前。货架上有两种灯泡——冷光和暖光。他拿起暖光的那个。他想——她喜欢暖的。*\n画面碎了。\n苏念睁开眼。\n杯子在她手里。咖啡凉了。她的手指"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 19,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian draws latte art in the foam",
    "spoken_dialogue": "为什么是咖啡",
    "dialogue_speaker": "grandmother",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她记得咖啡怎么冲。记得拉花怎么做。记得外婆的便签。但\"为什么是咖啡\"——这个问题的答案，空了。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 20,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands behind counter, breathing slowly, eyes cast down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "像一本书被撕掉了第一页。后面的都在，但开头没了。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 21,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at, motionless",
    "spoken_dialogue": "苏念？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"苏念？\"顾深看着她。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 22,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian sets the cup down on the counter",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "苏念放下杯子。她的手在发抖。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 23,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen drains the cup in one gulp",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你喝完之后——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你喝完之后——\"顾深的声音很轻，\"又变了。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 24,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian looks up",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你看到了什么？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念抬头看着他。他的灰色眼睛里没有质问，只有困惑。\n\"你看到了什么？\"他问。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 25,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian sees something",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的嘴唇动了一下。她想说——我看到了你的记忆。我看到了你第一次来的时候在想什么。我看到了你关掉了收购计划。我看到了你挑了一个暖光灯泡。\n但她什么都没说。\n她只"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 26,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly, motionless",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你为什么不关掉那个收购计划？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "然后她说了一句话。声音很轻，但每个字都清晰：\n\"你为什么不关掉那个收购计划？\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 27,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen hand pauses mid-motion",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你怎么知道的？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "顾深的手停在杯子上。\n\"你怎么知道的？\"他的声音没有惊讶，只有平静。像是他一直在等这个问题。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 28,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at, motionless",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念没回答。\n顾深看着她。暖光灯泡的光洒在他的脸上，把他的影子投在吧台上。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 29,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen smiles faintly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "因为我第一次来的时候，",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Warmth",
    "source_text": "\"因为我第一次来的时候，\"他说，\"你笑了一下。很小的一下。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 30,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen stands up from the seat",
    "spoken_dialogue": "明天见。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他站起来，拿起公文包。\n\"明天见。\"他说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 31,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian turns around",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他走到门口。手推开门——\n风铃掉了。\n清脆的一声响。金属风铃从门框上脱落，砸在地板上，弹了两下，滚到苏念脚边。\n顾深转身。他看着地上的风铃，又看着苏念。\n苏念蹲"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 32,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "the wind chimes ring softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "小念，别喝最后一杯。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "handwriting",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "是外婆的字迹。\n苏念把风铃翻过来。背面还有一行小字，刻在金属上，很小，几乎看不见：\n*\"小念，别喝最后一杯。\"*"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 33,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian trembles visibly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "苏念的手在发抖。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 34,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen turns and leaves",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她抬头。门口已经没有人了。顾深走了。\n但门还开着。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 35,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands up from the seat",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "小念，你哥哥的最后一杯，也是顾深的第一杯。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "门外，雨停了。阳光从云缝里漏下来，照在巷子的青石板上。\n苏念站起来，走到门口。她看着那道阳光——暖的，像新换的灯泡。\n她低头看了看手里的风铃。\n然后她把风铃挂回"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 36,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian picks up the sticky note",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念蹲在地上，手指碰着那张便签。纸面冰凉，像是刚从冰箱里拿出来。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 37,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian looks down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她抬头看门外。\n巷子里空无一人。但阳光照在青石板上，把一块石头的影子拉得很长——\n影子的形状，像一个人。\n苏念低头再看。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 38,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands behind counter, breathing slowly, eyes cast down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
